<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89031" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσελ-αύνω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ελῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					6.2.18
				</span></i>
			: aor. 1
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήλᾰσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					4.72
				</span></i>
			: Coan non-thematic 3pl.
			pres. ind. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτέλαντι</span>
			dub. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				1025.6
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv/iii B.C.)</span>:—<i>drive</i> or <i>chase
			to</i> a place, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰς πρὸς τὴν
			Νίσαιαν</span> Th.l.c.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοῦν</span>
			<u>SIG</u>l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὸν ἵππον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.755b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τινὰ φιλοσοφία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.L.
					7.5
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be driven</i> or <i>fixed to</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τοὔδαφος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Crass.</u>
					25
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> mostly intr.,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππον</span>) <i>ride towards, ride up</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὸ στρατόπεδον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.208
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				9.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				4.2.17
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλήλοις</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1.4.23
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἵππῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					9.44
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				4.5.7
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.4.17
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἐπὶκαμήλων</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				6.2.18
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ προσελαύνοντες</span>, opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ προσθέοντες</span> (the infantry),
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>An.</u>
				6.3.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατόν</span>) <i>march up</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔπω ἧκεν ἀλλ᾽ ἔτι προσήλαυνε</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				1.5.12
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of time,
				<i>approach</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τὸν ἀεὶ ἑξῆς καὶ -οντα χρόνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMasp.</u>
					158.27
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PFlor.</u>
				294.102
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>, etc.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
